---
import { SITE, SITE_A, NAV, IMAGE_CREDITS } from '../consts';
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="mt-auto border-t border-line bg-band text-white on-dark">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-10 px-5 py-14 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
    <div class="min-w-0">
      <p class="text-lg font-black break-words">{SITE.name}</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed break-words text-accent">
        <a
          href={SITE_A.aboutUrl}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="underline decoration-accent/40 underline-offset-2 hover:text-white"
          title="認識楊怡強醫師（個人網站）"
        >
          {SITE.poweredBy}
        </a>
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-xs text-sm leading-relaxed break-words text-body/85">
        免費、免註冊、不收集個資的滑雪運動醫學工具平台。
      </p>
    </div>

    <nav aria-label="頁尾選單" class="min-w-0">
      <p class="mb-3 text-sm font-bold text-accent">網站導覽</p>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-body/85">
        {
          NAV.map((item) => (
            <li>
              <a
                href={item.href}
                class="hover:text-white hover:underline"
                target={item.href.startsWith('http') ? '_blank' : undefined}
                rel={item.href.startsWith('http') ? 'noopener noreferrer' : undefined}
              >
                {item.label}
                {item.href.startsWith('http') && <span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span>}
              </a>
            </li>
          ))
        }
        <li><a href="/ski-medicine" class="hover:text-white hover:underline">滑雪傷害圖鑑</a></li>
        <li><a href="/injury-prevention" class="hover:text-white hover:underline">傷害預防指南</a></li>
        <li><a href="/contact" class="hover:text-white hover:underline">聯絡</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <div class="min-w-0">
      <p class="mb-3 text-sm font-bold text-accent">重要提醒</p>
      <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed break-words text-muted">
        本網站內容為一般性健康衛教資訊，不能取代醫師面對面的診察、診斷或治療。若有身體不適或運動傷害，請儘速就醫並與您的主治醫師討論。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 圖片出處（CC BY 授權要求標示作者與來源） -->
  <div class="border-t border-white/10">
    <details class="group mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-4">
      <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center gap-2 text-xs text-muted/70 hover:text-muted [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
        <span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block transition-transform group-open:rotate-90">▸</span>
        <span>圖片出處 Image credits（CC 授權標示，點開查看）</span>
      </summary>
      <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted/80">
        {
          IMAGE_CREDITS.map((c) => (
            <li class="break-words">
              <span class="text-body/85">{c.where}：</span>
              <a
                href={c.sourceUrl}
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer license"
                class="underline decoration-white/30 underline-offset-2 hover:text-white"
              >
                “{c.title}”
              </a>
              {' by '}
              <a
                href={c.authorUrl}
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer author"
                class="underline decoration-white/30 underline-offset-2 hover:text-white"
              >
                {c.author}
              </a>
              {' / '}
              <a
                href={c.licenseUrl}
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer license"
                class="underline decoration-white/30 underline-offset-2 hover:text-white"
              >
                {c.license}
              </a>
              <span class="text-muted/70">（{c.modified}）</span>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
    </details>
  </div>

  <div class="border-t border-white/10">
    <div
      class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col gap-2 px-5 py-5 text-xs text-muted sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between"
    >
      <p>© {year} {SITE.name}</p>
      <p>Taiwan · Ski &amp; Snowsports Medicine</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
